+# Sharing documents
+
+## Share links
+
+A share link sends one document to one person. Each link has its own address, /l/<link id>,
+and the library counts every open through it, so you can see who read what.
+
+## Who can open a link
+
+Anyone with the link can open it, and a visitor needs no account. The people in your library
+can create links for any of its documents and see every link and its opens.
+
+## What a visitor sees
+
+A visitor sees the document's title and can download it. Their opens appear on the document
+page for the people in the library.
